      "value": "@{5a6601ed92b3ff44cffeb39d|full_name}: As a temporary fix, when using TouchLink, you should switch to my or AeroScripts' fork here: https://github.com/TripingPC/Oculus_Touch_Steam_Link/\nFor anyone else that might run across this:\nignore above link, use this one instead https://github.com/hyblocker/Oculus_Touch_Steam_Link\nYou can disable individual trackers.\nKeep note that it won't allow you to use the VR Object controller while also using the Rift as your headset because it can't despawn the device created by the Oculus SteamVR driver.",
