  "details": "VRChat Version: IK2.0\nDescription of the bug: I use my oculus touch as hip tracker(https://gist.github.com/kaaori/b1428b9111b4d8cd11658ac1ac44f6e9), but after IK2.0 update, game is crashed when I use than.\nit is ok only use vive 3.0 tracker or headset\nbefore physbone update, I used IK2.0 beta and no problem. But update physbone main server, game is crashed. So i can't use IK2.0 beta.\nBut now. IK2.0 is released main server and I can't play game to use FBT.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): use oculus touch as hip (https://gist.github.com/kaaori/b1428b9111b4d8cd11658ac1ac44f6e9",
